      "Language": "chi",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": [
        {
          "NlmCategory": "OBJECTIVE",
          "Label": "OBJECTIVE",
          "content": "To discussion the effects of Huoxue components of effective drug in treating unstable angina in patients with blood stasis WBC (WBC), C-reactive protein (CRP), interleukin-6 (IL-6) and tumor necrosis factor alpha (TNF-alpha)."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "METHODS",
          "Label": "METHOD",
          "content": "one hundred and twenty cases of unstable angina were randomly divided into the conventional therapy group, component compatibility group, Pieces group and Xuesaitong group 4 groups, each with 30 cases. Observation of patients before and after treatment of clinical efficacy, blood lipid indicators and the indicators changes."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "RESULTS",
          "Label": "RESULT",
          "content": "Component compatibility group after treatment clinical marked improvement in conditions, and the WBC, CRP, IL-6 and TNF-alpha, TC, TG levels lower than before treatment, there were significant differences (P < 0.05), and lower than the other three groups After treatment (P < 0.05). And HDL-C after treatment than before treatment increased, there were significant differences (P < 0. 05)."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "CONCLUSIONS",
          "Label": "CONCLUSION",
          "content": "Huoxue-effective component compatibility can be effective treatment of unstable angina blood stasis, and could inhibit the inflammatory level."
        }
      ]},
